     IDQ.DSB_UOPS
             (Event 79H, Umask 08H) Increment each cycle.  # of uops delivered
             to IDQ from DSB path.  Set Cmask = 1 to count cycles.  Can com‐
             bine Umask 08H and 10H

     IDQ.MS_DSB_UOPS
             (Event 79H, Umask 10H) Increment each cycle # of uops delivered
